'''Magical Pokémon Journey: Eggcellent Togepi''' is the twenty-second monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]]. It contains the 33rd and 34th chapters of the manga. The chapters originally released in this book were later re-released as part of {{Vol|Magical Pokémon Journey|6}}. As a bonus, it contained a fold-out color poster which was not part of the regular volume.
==Blurb==
'''''SURROGATE POKéMON'''''

''Hazel finds an egg floating down the river one day, but while Pikachu and Clefairy are acting as egg-sitters, the rest of the Pokémon are thinking about what kind of omelet they want to make! Will this egg hatch or become breakfast?''

